1
00:00:00,566 --> 00:00:02,736
(Penny:)you should be able to pick
whichever hobbit you want.

2
00:00:04,103 --> 00:00:06,603
(Penny:)Wish you wouldn't,
but one problem at a time.

3
00:00:09,075 --> 00:00:10,955
(Leonard:)You make a lot of sense.

4
00:00:11,611 --> 00:00:13,781
(Leonard:)I like this table,
and I'm getting it.

5
00:00:13,913 --> 00:00:15,953
(Penny:)Really? This one?

6
00:00:18,217 --> 00:00:19,457
(Leonard:)That one?

7
00:00:19,952 --> 00:00:21,592
(Leonard:)Damn right I like that one.

8
00:00:25,625 --> 00:00:27,435
(Amy:)-Hey.
-Good news.

9
00:00:27,593 --> 00:00:31,303
(Howard:)Someone in this room
gets to take a ride on a rocket.

10
00:00:31,397 --> 00:00:34,237
(Penny:)Fine.
Can I at least shower first?

11
00:00:35,434 --> 00:00:36,434
(Howard:)No, not that.

12
00:00:36,602 --> 00:00:38,482
(Howard:)Although you already agreed
to it, so no take-backs.

13
00:00:39,138 --> 00:00:40,208
(Bernadette:)What are you talking about?

14
00:00:40,373 --> 00:00:41,643
(Howard:)Sit down.

15
00:00:42,942 --> 00:00:44,422
(Howard:)NASA called.

16
00:00:44,577 --> 00:00:47,557
(Howard:)The telescope mount
I installed on the space station

17
00:00:47,713 --> 00:00:52,063
(Howard:)got damaged, and they want me
to go back up and fix it.

18
00:00:53,319 --> 00:00:54,459
(Raj:)Wow.

19
00:00:55,254 --> 00:00:56,664
(Bernadette:)Well, what did you say?

20
00:00:56,822 --> 00:00:59,392
What do you think I....?
I said yes!

21
00:00:59,492 --> 00:01:00,492
(Howard:)Why do you look surprised?

